    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d38">

                <pb facs="0066" n="48" sameAs="frus:frus1948v03/pg48"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">840.20/3–1148</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        British Ambassador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Inverchapel</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-03-12">March 12, 1948</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Mr. Ambassador</hi>: Please inform Mr. Bevin
                    that in accordance Avith your <hi rendition="#italic">aide-mémoire</hi> of March
                    11, 1948, Ave are prepared to proceed at once in the joint discussions on the
                    establishment of an Atlantic security system.</p>
                <p>I suggest the prompt arrival of the British representative early next week.</p>
                <p>Faithfully yours,</p>
                <p rendition="#right">[File copy not signed]</p>
            </div>
